# ============================================================
# Documentation policy
# Keep the root README plus one per module (backend-spring, frontend-angular, kairos-service)
# ============================================================

**/README.md
!/README.md
!/backend-spring/README.md
!/frontend-angular/README.md
!/kairos-service/README.md